### Dealer ledger

Use one consistent server-side financial calculation engine.

Formula:

Closing Balance = Opening Balance + Debits - Credits

The ledger must support:

- Opening balance.
- Invoice debits.
- Verified payment credits.
- Approved credit notes.
- Approved debit notes.
- Adjustments.
- Reversals.
- Running balance.
- Date filters.
- Transaction references.
- Downloadable statement.

Never use a manually entered closing balance.

Never calculate official financial balances differently in separate screens.

